      "text": "add seven n minus one time.",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 212.34,
      "text": "So this is an explicit definition of it,",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 214.4,
      "text": "but we could also do it recursively.",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 215.86,
      "text": "We could also say, we could also, so",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 218.76,
      "text": "just to be clear, this is one definition",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 221.32,
      "text": "where we write it like this, we write",
