    },
    {
      "t": 274.26,
      "text": "first term, it would be some constant, plus,",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 278.28,
      "text": "plus some number that you're incrementing, or I",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 282.86,
      "text": "guess this could be a negative number, or",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 284.2,
      "text": "decrementing by, times n minus one, so this",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 287.92,
      "text": "is one way to define an arithmetic sequence.",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 291.26,
      "text": "In this case, d was two, in this",
