    },
    {
      "t": 299.8,
      "text": "k is 100.",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 302.1,
      "text": "The other way that you could, if you",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 303.72,
      "text": "wanted to write the recursive way of defining",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 306.0,
      "text": "an arithmetic sequence generally, you could say a",
