      "text": "previous term, plus four.",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 394.04,
      "text": "So it's going to be the previous term,",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 396.06,
      "text": "it's going to be the previous term, plus",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 398.24,
      "text": "whatever your index is, plus whatever your index",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 401.7,
      "text": "is.",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 402.52,
      "text": "So this looks close, but notice here we're",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 404.9,
      "text": "changing the amount that we're adding based on",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 406.88,
      "text": "what our index is, we're adding the amount",
