    },
    {
      "t": 408.38,
      "text": "of index to the previous term, and so",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 410.12,
      "text": "this is four, n is greater than or",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 412.52,
      "text": "equal to two, while for an arithmetic sequence",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 414.66,
      "text": "we're adding the same amount regardless, regardless of",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
    {
      "t": 418.18,
      "text": "what our index is, here we're adding the",
      "speaker": "S1"
    },
